{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hope Town</strong> is a highly challenging Rogue-like turn-based RPG. Recruit, train, and lead a team of heroes to explore procedurally generated maps, uncover stories through dynamic events, and battle formidable enemies. Collect resources to upgrade your stronghold, craft powerful gear, and eradicate the darkness to restore hope to the world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>30+ hours of gameplay</strong> with HD pixel-art visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permadeath mechanics</strong>: Every hero boasts unique appearances, traits, classes, and abilities\u2014but only one life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Innovative turn-based combat</strong>: Strategically rotate heroes mid-battle based on their traits to survive and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Total of 4 </strong>maps<strong>, 100+ </strong>enemies<strong>, 200+ </strong>equipment pieces<strong>, 15 </strong>weapon types<strong>, 150 </strong>skills<strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual-wield synergy</strong>: 15 distinct weapons with skill-chaining combos when wielded together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic Rogue-like elements</strong>: Permadeath, procedurally generated maps, and endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music is provided by [\u4e4c\u9e26Producer]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665740?t=1745467074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665740?t=1745467074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665740/69aafc36d0a4187d4ba6ab5678ce8152ab3b941a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745467074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665740/69aafc36d0a4187d4ba6ab5678c